            "code": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Includes 1x <strong><em>Igni</em>Cognition</strong> + 1x <strong><em>Igni</em>Longevity</strong> bottles.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>\n<em>Igni</em>Cognition™</h2>\n<h5>1 BOTTLE – 60 CAPSULES</h5>\n<h3>The World’s Most Powerful Cognition Supplement<br>Born from Light. Backed by Science™<br>\n</h3>\n<p>Unlock elite mental performance with <em>Igni</em>Cognition—a next-generation nootropic infused with quantum-charged <em>Igni</em>ton technology. In a university-led, placebo-controlled study, participants saw an average 47% improvement across five key cognitive markers in just 30 days. Most users feel the difference within the first 72 hours.</p>\n<p>The <em>Igni</em>Cognition formula combines proven nootropic ingredients with our proprietary cold plasma enhancement process, amplifying their bioavailability and neural impact while reducing dosage by up to 60%. Expect sharper focus, enhanced memory, faster processing speed, and lasting mental stamina—without overstimulation or crash.</p>\n<p>✔️ Clinically studied<br>✔️ GRAS-certified ingredients<br>✔️ Quantum-enhanced performance<br>✔️ Fast-acting with measurable results</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>\n<em>Igni</em>Longevity™</h2>\n<h5>1 BOTTLE – 60 CAPSULES</h5>\n<h3>Quantum-Enhanced Support for a Longer, Stronger Life<br>Cellular Vitality. Reduced Inflammation Markers. Enhanced Resilience.</h3>\n<p>Designed to help you live not just longer—but better—<em>Igni</em>Longevity is a breakthrough formula that targets the root causes of aging at the molecular level. Enhanced using our proprietary Igniton technology, this supplement improves the body's stress response, reduces oxidative damage, and supports cardiovascular and immune function with unmatched efficiency.</p>\n<p>In clinical trials, <em>Igni</em>Longevity cut Interleukin-6 (IL-6) levels by 50% and reduced C-reactive protein (CRP) by 28% in just 60 days—two major biomarkers of inflammation and aging. Every ingredient is GRAS-certified and enhanced for higher efficacy at lower dosages, thanks to our cold plasma quantum embedding process.</p>\n<p>✔️ Reduces inflammation markers &amp; oxidative stress<br>✔️ Supports heart &amp; immune system health<br>✔️ Scientifically backed by peer-reviewed studies<br>✔️ Formulated for longevity, optimized by Ignitons</p>"
          }
